# Core Rules

## Content and Structure
- Content in French except technical terms
- Course: 5 days (6.5h/day), 30-40% theory
- Examples follow theory sections
- Exercises in separate files (see rules/exercises.rules)

## Section Order
1. Introduction et installation de Windows Server
2. DNS
3. Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS)
4. Utilisateurs et ordinateurs Active Directory
5. Unités d'organisation (OU)
6. Strategies de groupes (GPO)
7. Gestion AD DS en PowerShell

## Core Infrastructure
- Domain: computerelectronics.be (192.168.0.x)
- Main DC + 1-2 workstations
- Details: rules/infrastructure.rules

## Essential Standards
- GPO: GPO-[Type]-[Name]
- Groups: [DL/GG/U]-[Name]
- Design specs: rules/design.rules
- Exercise format: rules/templates/

## Writing Style
- Friendly, clear, active voice
- Student tasks: "Vous allez..."
- Joint demos: "Nous allons..."
- Bold for key points

# Current Restrictions
- No PowerShell generation
- No exercise creation without permission
- Examples must use computerelectronics.be infrastructure
